{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever been excited to ride a rollercoaster only to be disappointed afterwards? In Coasterama, your job is to make sure these tiny guys don't! Complete over 40 brainteasing puzzles and make the tallest and fastest rollercoaster for our tiny guys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023850/extras/fc5415b8a9b874128e34a7cd16c06891.poster.avif?t=1758115566\" width=800 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023850/extras/fc5415b8a9b874128e34a7cd16c06891.webm?t=1758115566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023850/extras/fc5415b8a9b874128e34a7cd16c06891.mp4?t=1758115566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tiny guys wants something special for their rollercoaster. Do they want to go fast? Do they want to go very high? Do they want to go in a very boring straight line? The options are endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing remaining is figuring out how to combine all these options in a single track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023850/extras/f6274942cffc06b64bc207bdddb9fd23.poster.avif?t=1758115566\" width=800 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023850/extras/f6274942cffc06b64bc207bdddb9fd23.webm?t=1758115566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023850/extras/f6274942cffc06b64bc207bdddb9fd23.mp4?t=1758115566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is important so be sure to make everyone happy to complete the puzzle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023850/extras/a2bf15522200bc28309ae77c704717ad.poster.avif?t=1758115566\" width=750 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023850/extras/a2bf15522200bc28309ae77c704717ad.webm?t=1758115566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023850/extras/a2bf15522200bc28309ae77c704717ad.mp4?t=1758115566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete over 40 unique puzzles in 3 different worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover unexpected solutions that will keep you thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time without and enjoy simple and brainteasing puzzles without having to worry about time limits or scores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with only your mouse.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023850?t=1758115566","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4023850?t=1758115566","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023850/db638f4c749b86c0eeb2e6a6be806835e87997a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758115566","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023850/db638f4c749b86c0eeb2e6a6be806835e87997a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758115566","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":